<mxCell id="t2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="Every page lives under /admin (PROD: /nexora/admin). The nav shows only pages whose *.view code you hold; the server re-checks each action&#x27;s own code. Changes to users/permissions apply within 30 s (NEXORA_USER_CACHE_TTL) - no re-login needed." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="52" width="1600" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
