<mxCell id="t43" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="- ProcessName must be exactly &amp;lt;customer&amp;gt;.&amp;lt;process&amp;gt;; the permission code is derived from it and the doc-field search fails closed (zero rows) for any process nobody granted.&lt;br&gt;- Organization codes are 1-5 letters/digits; client codes 2-50 lowercase letters/digits/underscore.&lt;br&gt;- Skip steps 2-4 when the customer runs on the existing Octo runtime: use ClientCode &#x27;default&#x27;.&lt;br&gt;- A user sees a process only if BOTH hold: their profile (or override) grants process.&amp;lt;client&amp;gt;.&amp;lt;name&amp;gt;.view AND the process source&#x27;s organization matches their own (or they hold an .all scope).&lt;br&gt;- Deleting a process source that reporting or mappings still reference is refused; delete children first.&lt;br&gt;- Deleting a tenant with member organizations is refused; move the organizations first." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="450" width="1800" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
